        "id": 1944400
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T22:24:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, after https://crrev.com/c/4197000 it will be possible to access the `Hypervisor` here and then you can add a hypervisor capability to control this, like https://crrev.com/c/4197001 does",
      "parentUuid": "0e5af304_b7420d9f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 316,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 318,
        "endChar": 94
      },
      "revId": "897a758931505be142ef35b28a2525290091787d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
