      "writtenOn": "2023-01-31T22:38:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should there be dedicated capability or is\n\n```\nprotection_type.isolates_memory() \u003d\u003d true \u0026\u0026 hypervisor.check_capability(HypervisorCap::StaticSwiotlbAllocationRequired)\n```\n\ngood enough?",
      "parentUuid": "d37fe403_f315ef3a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 316,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 318,
        "endChar": 94
      },
      "revId": "897a758931505be142ef35b28a2525290091787d",
